{"id":"n84583-2-9","stage":5,"title":"하찮다 · 无关紧要","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84583-2-9-1","ko":"저 남자애들은 대체 무슨 이야기를 하고 있는 거니?","zh":"那几个男生到底在聊什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남자애들은","meaning":"男孩子","explanation":"남자애：男孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"남자애","audio":"/audio/92376495d295485257e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:남자애:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자애","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。